              }
            ]
          },
          "proof_contract_plan": {
            "state": "unproved proposal; no local proof/native approval",
            "obligations": [
              "Develop metrizable complete locally convex section spaces and prove the Fr\u00e9chet open-mapping theorem by Baire and successive approximation; Banach open mapping is only an analogy",
              "Prove Schwartz compact-perturbation and its compact morphism of Fr\u00e9chet complexes finite-dimensional/Hausdorff cohomology corollary",
              "Define coherent section topology as a closed-relation quotient and show chart/generator independence using Artin\u2013Rees/Krull",
              "Prove several-variable Montel from polydisc Cauchy estimates, Ascoli and diagonal compact exhaustion (the imported named Montel theorem is plane-only)",
