              "Construct finite nested Leray covers of P^r subordinate to distinguished resolution neighborhoods and justify all finite-intersection acyclicity",
              "If intersections are not coordinate polydiscs, explicitly prove their pseudoconvex chart geometry and scalar Dolbeault vanishing, then coherent dimension shifting; do not apply pair3 to arbitrary intersections",
              "Apply the proved compact-complex theorem to the resulting restriction of \u010cech complexes",
              "This contains substantial internal prerequisites and remains unproved."
