+                "title": "M. S. Narasimhan and T. R. Ramadas, Geometry of SU(2) Gauge Fields, CMP67 (1979), 121–136",
+                "url": "https://scispace.com/pdf/geometry-of-su-2-gauge-fields-3mpojvnw66.pdf",
