+            "thm-elliptic-differential-operators-on-compact-vector-bundles-have-parametrices-and-regularity": "mathematical-premise",
+            "lem-neumann-series-and-small-perturbations-of-bounded-inverses": "mathematical-premise"
+          },
+          "statement": "For A in A_k^*, d_A^*d_A:H^{k+1}(adP)→H^{k-1}(adP) is an isomorphism with bounded inverse G_A, and H^k(T*M tensor adP)=im d_A direct-sum ker d_A^*. The bounded projection onto im d_A is d_A G_A d_A^*. The inverse and projections depend smoothly on A near each irreducible A.",
